    "directions": [
      "Add the butter-washed whiskey, cold brew, saline or salt, and bitters into a mixing glass with ice. Stir to shill, then and strain into a mug and top with the vanilla cold foam. Top with shaved chocolate.",
      "Melt 5 oz. of butter in a pan over medium heat until browned (5-10 min). Remove from the heat and combine with 750 ml. of Roe & Co in a sealed container. Shake gently every 10 minutes for 1 hour. Freeze until the butter solidifies, then strain through cheesecloth to remove the solids.",
      "Whip 3 Tbsp. of heavy cream with 1 tsp. of vanilla extract."
    ],
